TREE SPECIES SELECTION FOR STREET PLANTING IN THE CENTRAL BUSINESS DISTRICT OF RAJSHAHI
Md. Asaduzzaman1, Nafis Sadat2
1AssistantProfessor,DepartmentofArchitecture,FacultyofCivil Engineering,RajshahiUniversityofEngineering&Technology,Rajshahi6204,Bangladesh
